ple  making up the massive organization are  just that people by furthering the  divide between the general public and a  member of the scp foundation you only  ensure 105-1 already knew he continued  organizations that protect mankind from  anomalous objects have existed all over  the world for a long time although there  have been numerous ways of protection it  is indispensable to gain knowledge of  anomalies and the processes inevitably  include experiments using living human  beings this varies depending on times  and regions such as criminals slaves  different ethnic groups and so on  nevertheless it is still largely eroded  in the minds of the researchers some  people could not bear their sins and  threw themselves into the sea another  person eliminated the distinction  between life and death to keep his peace  of mind but then he killed his family  due to a slight quarrel i told many  personnel repeatedly that these  sacrifices led to protecting the world  such words are however only so effective  and many personnel's hearts were  understandably broken but i found that  lamp the circumstances were coincidental  but its effect is noteworthy researchers  have been able to study gruesome  anomalies without so much a care in the  world as a result their work efficiency  dramatically increased and the damage  caused by abnormalities was soon  negligible of course the feelings  remained but there were measures in  place now amnestics advanced anomalous  therapies if we wanted we could remove  the very emotion of sadness from a man's  psyche but we couldn't we're already far  too gone and the lasting effects of this  lamp weigh on my mind the way it is  those who abandon their responsibility  for death by themselves become  heterogeneous in daily life where  general morality exists they had become  impossible to live among the general  public institutions such as the ethics  committee the board of directors  responsible for maintaining the  foundation's moral integrity can only do  so much when surrounded by the amount of  death the average secure facility deals  with this is likely why directives such  as the acquittal protocol are greenlit  it doesn't entirely negate the effects  of death but it works pretty well as a  cheap simple organization-wide mnistic  pushing the uncomfortable memories and  thoughts to the back of the mind until  they're absolutely needed and even then  making sure to sugarcoat them in the  most detached robotic way possible so  the next time you think you want to  submit a job application to the scp  foundation  think of  scp-001 as well as all the other  difficult immoral tasks you may be asked  to perform is throwing away your  humanity in service of the goal of  containment to noble one what about  changing the impact of one of life's  most constant elements  death whatever the answer may be there's  one thing everyone can agree on the life  of foundation personnel is not for  everyone and it certainly isn't easy on  the mind now go check out scp-001 the  way the world ends reality unfolds and  scp-001 which is the real zero zero one  scp animation for more wicked and wild  scp-001  possibilities

